ET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6744f5cc45e7012fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_GardeningTeachings</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_GardeningTeachings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_GardeningTeachings\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">18f75eaa-c2b1-42af-966a-59452af0d37e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:18f75eaa-c2b1-42af-966a-59452af0d37e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:18f75eaa-c2b1-42af-966a-59452af0d37e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple\" title=\"Open Hand Temple\">Open Hand Temple</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-85&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-4</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A non-denominational guide to gardening for faithful folk.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Whomever you pop your prayers toward, everyone needs healing - and you can't afford a blessing or miracle for every scraped knee. That's where the most holy art of planting shrubs comes in.\n</p><p><b>What to grow: HEALING</b>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Rogue%27s_Morsel\" title=\"Rogue's Morsel\">Rogue's Morsel</a>: <i>Best grown in the dark and dusk, you can even plant these in cellars! Amazing.</i>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Balsam\" title=\"Balsam\">Balsam</a>: <i>A spindly flower that takes well to tall and chilly climes.</i>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals\" title=\"Yellow Musk Creeper Petals\">Yellow Musk Creeper</a>: <i>Now, these ones are a tad... difficult. They do feed on human corpses, which doesn't fit in with an awful lot of faiths. But think about it - really cuts down on graveyard space!</i>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><b>What to grow: POISONS</b>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Mugwort\" title=\"Mugwort\">Mugwort</a>: <i>This stuff cures any poison when refined right - but it does smell awful powerful. Stink out a whole temple, this will.</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215628\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27086/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8642/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930867/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.215      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.215      1 -total\n 49.41%   25.799      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.39%   22.654     15 Template: